---\
\
# Core Idea\
\
The experiment investigates a simple hypothesis:\
\
> **Orientation is not contained in isolated states.**\
> **Orientation emerges through stable relations between states.**\
\
Instead of asking\
\
> *"What is the value?"*\
\
the experiment asks\
\
> *"How do relations create navigable structure?"*\
\
